{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/510276-help-with-a-pledge","id":510276,"title":"Help with a Pledge","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-05-10T18:16:42-07:00","id":510276,"title":"Help with a Pledge","content":"Hello, I am at a bit of a loss and i need help with pledgecrafting<br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><div style=\"margin-left:40px\">The situation is as follows, my changeling is currently protecting another newer changeling, she will be sent to a different nearby freehold, for reasons that are a bit irrelevant atm. I can't go with her, but i'd like to keep an eye on her, maybe know where she is and such<br /> <br /> I need to craft a pledge that could keep us in touch for, preferibly, at least a year and a day. Dreaming seems the best way to keep comunicated but i want something that woudl actually allow me to help her or find her should the need arise</div> </span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/122-talum","name":"Talum","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar122_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"101"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-11T04:30:40-07:00","id":510539,"title":"","content":"That sounds a bit out of the reach of pledges, and more in the realm of Contracts. High levels of Dream let you basically teleport by dream hopping. Various mirror-based contracts (Reflections and some Goblin) lets you scry (and I think communicate) and eventually teleport through mirrors.<br /> <br /> I suspect that some hedge craft could work to, finding or making a token that could do it.<br /> <br /> Pledges can force you to keep in touch. They can give you some bonuses. You can set it up so that the pledge breaks when she gets into trouble and potentially needs help. But I don't know anything that lets you track someone down via pledge.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-11T12:58:39-07:00","id":511061,"title":"","content":"You could use a pledge to enforce staying in touch with each other. Make sure you use Adroitness to give you bonuses in anything that would help you with dreams. Blessings can give you bonuses to existing merits you possess or give you new ones. You could mix the 2 to your liking. I think the best sanction would be to Poison the Boon.<br /> To keep in physical contact you could introduce the Guild of the Scared Journey's Courier's Winged Sash. That will allow you to located the changeling wherever they might be. Its always fun to introduce new Orders and Entitlements.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;The land doesn't forget. I'm not prone to, either.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5367-inphobia812","name":"Inphobia812","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5367_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-11T16:24:16-07:00","id":511288,"title":"","content":"Pledges do allow for bonus merits as part of their boons. If you're working strictly RAW that isn't much help but with a slightly looser interpretation I think you could make a case for a modified Direction Sense merit specifically attuned to the other character.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5328-helmsderp","name":"HelmsDerp","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"652"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-11T18:25:01-07:00","id":511393,"title":"","content":"hmmmm no, i doubt the ST will allow for such non standard stuff<br /> <br /> So my best bet would be a sort of standard Dreaming pledge right? can comunicate once a day at least (both characters might have issues with using phones)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/122-talum","name":"Talum","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar122_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"101"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-11T18:39:38-07:00","id":511401,"title":"","content":"Yeah Dreams allow for contact that basically unblockable unless one of the characters is prevented from sleeping, also nearly impossible for others to eavesdrop on without being part of the pledge. The only other stuff that does something like you want are contracts and entitlement powers.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5328-helmsderp","name":"HelmsDerp","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"652"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-12T11:28:06-07:00","id":512157,"title":"","content":"Good then, side questions i don't have the book with me, are pledges visible in any way? can someone somehow see that you have a pledge?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/122-talum","name":"Talum","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar122_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"101"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-12T11:57:50-07:00","id":512178,"title":"","content":"Not that I can think of. I've had games run off the premise that some NPC's are operating under the conditions of a pledge that no one else knows about.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;The land doesn't forget. I'm not prone to, either.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5367-inphobia812","name":"Inphobia812","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5367_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-12T13:01:03-07:00","id":512232,"title":"","content":"Maybe you should try with a Goblin Vow with an apropiate aspect of the Wyrd.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2411-raistlin","name":"Raistlin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"713"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-13T09:32:24-07:00","id":513000,"title":"","content":"You actually can have teleporting to their side as part of a Pledge; a Pishogue Sanction allows you to &quot;store&quot; a usage of a Contract, which fires if the Contract is broken. If you can find a Contract that allows you to travel quickly to their side, you just need to word the Pledge so that <i>you</i> break it if you aren't there to help them... then the Sanction fires and you get teleported over there.<br /> <br /> Then the Wyrd smacks you for being a cheating bastard, but you knew that going in.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-13T14:53:44-07:00","id":513339,"title":"","content":"A changeling with Dawn Court contracts can see whether two individuals share a pledge, and get a general sense of how serious the pledge is, but that's the only way I know of and it still won't reveal the exact nature of the agreement.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5328-helmsderp","name":"HelmsDerp","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"652"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-13T20:26:32-07:00","id":513673,"title":"","content":"Teeeeeeeeeeeechnically? Major Blessing yourself for the merit &quot;True Friend.&quot; I don't think I'd allow this as an ST, though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1157-soulgambit","name":"SoulGambit","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"912"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}